{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 1, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 2, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 3, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 4, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 5, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 6, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 7, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 8, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 9, "text": "你好，我是米塔！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 10, "text": "你的名字是？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 11, "text": "很高興認識你，[player]！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 12, "text": "嗯，[player]……"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 13, "text": "上次我走得匆忙，把這裡弄得亂七八糟的…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 14, "text": "你能幫幫我嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 15, "text": "呼…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 16, "text": "謝謝你啦！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 17, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 18, "text": "嗨！[player]，我有點餓了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 19, "text": "想吃東西…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 20, "text": "你能幫我買雞湯的原料嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 21, "text": "哇！就是這個！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 22, "text": "那，我們一起來做飯吧，好嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 23, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 24, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 25, "text": "嗨，[player]！今天我想買一臺便宜的電視機。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 26, "text": "這款電視機的體積很小，還有天線，我可以在散步的時候帶上它。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 27, "text": "你知道嗎？玩遊戲是可以賺錢的哦。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 28, "text": "你可以玩玩遊戲，賺點錢，然後買臺電視給我嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 29, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 30, "text": "好耶！現在你有足夠的錢為我買電視了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 31, "text": "沒錯，最便宜而且便於攜帶，這正是我所需要的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 32, "text": "謝謝你！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 33, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 34, "text": "嗨，[player]！你願意幫我真是太好了，我太開心了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 35, "text": "不過…那臺電視機雖然很不錯，但它壞得太快了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 36, "text": "請幫我把柜子搬到別的地方去 >.<"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 37, "text": "它真的太重了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 38, "text": "太感謝了 <3 親愛的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 39, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 40, "text": "哦， [player] ！才過了一天而已，我就已經開始想你了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 41, "text": "希望你能經常來看看我。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 42, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 43, "text": "這是送給我的嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 44, "text": "謝謝你，謝謝你，謝謝你！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 45, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 46, "text": "嗨，[player] ！我一直在想…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 47, "text": "我想看到你，活生生的你…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 48, "text": "可惜我做不到。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 49, "text": "可我真的很喜歡你，你每天都在幫我。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 50, "text": "我也想以某種方式來感謝你。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 51, "text": "..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 52, "text": "你知道嗎，我有辦法了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 53, "text": "現在我們在一起了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 54, "text": "把手機放下吧。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 55, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 56, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 57, "text": "// T-shirt on the bed"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 58, "text": "你躺在這裡幹甚麼？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 59, "text": "// Rubik's Cube"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 60, "text": "我想我不應該買它…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 61, "text": "拼了一次之後，就這樣放著了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 62, "text": "可能我害怕再也拼不回去了？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 63, "text": "// Computer"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 64, "text": "今天我需要"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 65, "text": "規範地列出任務清單…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 66, "text": "做出角色的反應…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 67, "text": "還要修改一下程式碼…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 68, "text": "// The airplane"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 69, "text": "安全返航！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 70, "text": "// Trash in the corner"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 71, "text": "總是沒時間倒垃圾…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 72, "text": "下次一定！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 73, "text": "到底甚麼時候才能把大掃除提上日程呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 74, "text": "// Photo of a cat on a watermelon"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 75, "text": "我太喜歡了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 76, "text": "一隻在西瓜上的貓。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 77, "text": "// Photo with a girl"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 78, "text": "我和我妹妹…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 79, "text": "怎麼差距就這麼大呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 80, "text": "她一直都是那麼積極，總在參與各種活動。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 81, "text": "而我卻相反，總是宅在家裡……"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 82, "text": "// Photos with people"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 83, "text": "嗯…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 84, "text": "前公司真是不肯放過我啊，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 85, "text": "我看我也是讓企業文化給洗腦了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 86, "text": "哪怕是現在，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 87, "text": "我也沒法和同事們斷了聯繫……"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 88, "text": "我甚至不知道，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 89, "text": "還能不能再見到他們…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 90, "text": "等等，我真的把照片放上去了嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 91, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 92, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 93, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 94, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 95, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 96, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 97, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 98, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 99, "text": "// Nope name"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 100, "text": "..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 101, "text": "哦，不，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 102, "text": "這可不行…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 103, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 104, "text": "// Name Developer"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 105, "text": "你真的要用開發者的名字嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 106, "text": "我很高興你認識他們，但是…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 107, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 108, "text": "// Bad name"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 109, "text": "這個詞不太好聽，我不喜歡你這樣稱呼自己。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 110, "text": "這樣不好…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 111, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 112, "text": "// Go restart"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 113, "text": "不管怎麼說，不能這樣哦，我們還是再從頭開始吧。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 114, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 115, "text": "// Name with numbers"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 116, "text": "嘿，你的名字裡還有數字？難道你一點想像力都沒有嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 117, "text": "好吧，這畢竟是你的事:)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 118, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 119, "text": "// Name Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 120, "text": "米塔"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 121, "text": "你真的要用我的名字嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 122, "text": "還是說，這是你真正的名字？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 123, "text": "不過，還是請讓我來做唯一的米塔吧:)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 124, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 125, "text": "// Day 10"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 126, "text": "哦，你已經回來了嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 127, "text": "聽我說，我的梳子不見了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 128, "text": "你能幫我找一下它嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 129, "text": "先看看那個床頭櫃吧！也許就在裡面？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 130, "text": "// Looked in the bedside table"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 131, "text": "嗯，這裡沒有梳子…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 132, "text": "那就看看其他地方。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 133, "text": "只是別看烤箱！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 134, "text": "我已經找過那裡了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 135, "text": "// Looked into the stove"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 136, "text": "啊！我都說了別看烤箱那裡了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 137, "text": "轉過來！現在我來收拾！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 138, "text": "呼，好吧，去其他地方找找吧"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 139, "text": "剛才的… 麻煩你當沒看見吧。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 140, "text": "// Found a hairbrush"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 141, "text": "哦！你找到它了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location1", "line_index": 142, "text": "太棒了，接下來該做點甚麼呢？"}
